{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/968a0c07035bbf4440436f13caab569a.avif?t=1769562204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras_big/968a0c07035bbf4440436f13caab569a.avif?t=1769562204 width=800 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc A Brand-New Sensation in Rhythm Action, Conducted by Thighs! \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master simple controls to command a pair of lovely thighs and vanquish the souls approaching from the back of the screen! Catch and purify souls to the upbeat rhythm... &quot;MOMO Crash&quot; is an exhilarating rhythm game with a novel theme like no other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcPersonalities on Full Blast! Three &quot;Thigh Warriors&quot; Await!\u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of chaos, they are the &quot;Thigh-Warriors,&quot; the sole wielders of the power of purification. Look forward to their cute and powerful exploits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/0e999f705b62f427bd34007e7845c49d.webp?t=1769562204\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/0e999f705b62f427bd34007e7845c49d.poster.avif?t=1769562204\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Daia (The Confident and Unstoppable Eternal Diamond High-Teen)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fascinate, Pierce, Dominate\u2014\u2014The Perfectly Self-Produced Thighs&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daia, the &quot;Jewel Girl&quot; who shines with confidence and style! To her, &quot;KAWAII&quot; (cuteness) is justice and the ultimate form of self-expression. Wielding her perfectly toned &quot;Thighs&quot; as weapons, she fights and dazzles day in and day out to paint the world in her unique vision of &quot;KAWAII&quot;! Her goal: to become the president of the No.1 brand. No one can stop her ambition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/dcbeb8682f0276d9e0c882ebcbc201dd.webp?t=1769562204\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/dcbeb8682f0276d9e0c882ebcbc201dd.poster.avif?t=1769562204\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9c\u00a0Seika\u00a0(The Bashful, Heart-Fluttering, Philanthropic Sister with a Locked-Up Heart)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wanting to be saved, wanting to save\u2014\u2014Thighs like a Cage of Love Swirling Within&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seika is a shy sister torn between her duties in her sacred role and her earnest desire to be needed by someone. Hidden beneath her modest sister's attire, her &quot;Thighs&quot; hold a benevolent power to heal the world, and a &quot;Cage of Love&quot; concealing passions so fierce they sometimes threaten to imprison her. With those legs, what will she grasp? World peace, or her own small measure of happiness\u2014\u2014?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/fb759e0d7d8e464b80f8b40c4aef6a77.webp?t=1769562204\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/fb759e0d7d8e464b80f8b40c4aef6a77.poster.avif?t=1769562204\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1e\u00a0Hikaru\u00a0(The Wild, Sparkling, Optimistic Traveler with an Explosive Smile)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zero Guilt in Destruction\u2014\u2014The Naive Hyper-Crush Thighs&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to make everyone smile!&quot; With this pure wish as her sole guide, the innocent traveler Hikaru journeys the world! To find her missing sister, she heroically CRUSHES any obstacle with her prized &quot;Reinforced Thighs&quot;! Bright as the sun, her destructive power comes with absolutely no ill-will or guilt, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/cfc1f123d09781bd598cbb6b020aa897.avif?t=1769562204\" width=1138 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcEasy for anyone! Core gameplay explained!\u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple: just two actions\u2014<strong>Clamp</strong> and <strong>Kick</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different types of targets fly in to the rhythm, and it\u2019s up to you to respond with the right move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all\u2014this game also features a <strong>Story Mode</strong>, where you can experience the epic tales of the Thigh Warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story to unlock new tracks, then play them in rhythm game to deepen your bond with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance strengthens your relationships and even influences how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both <strong>\u201cThighs \u00d7 Rhythm Game\u201d</strong>, and save the world together with your favorite character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/15da3e3637223791366a7ec29852fc80.poster.avif?t=1769562204\" width=874 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/15da3e3637223791366a7ec29852fc80.webm?t=1769562204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/15da3e3637223791366a7ec29852fc80.mp4?t=1769562204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Flying &quot;Souls&quot;</strong> should be gently caught and held between the thighs  <br>at the right moment to be purified!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/c88372d777ccf1993a6f9450d9996a7e.poster.avif?t=1769562204\" width=874 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/c88372d777ccf1993a6f9450d9996a7e.webm?t=1769562204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/c88372d777ccf1993a6f9450d9996a7e.mp4?t=1769562204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udda0 But the <strong>&quot;Viruses&quot; that sometimes sneak in</strong> must be repelled with <br>a sharp Kick &amp; Crush of the thighs to the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extr